# Keep line endings sane for a repo that people edit on Windows, macOS and Linux.
# Files are stored with LF in the repository and checked out with LF, so a
# contributor's core.autocrlf setting cannot silently rewrite every line of a
# diff.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Not text
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
